{"blocks":[{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"Department for Work and Pensions ","tree_line_end":6,"tree_line_start":2},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" DECISION MAKING AND APPEALS (PART OF LEGAL GROUP) ","tree_line_end":10,"tree_line_start":7},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":14,"tree_line_start":11},{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":"Decision Makers Guide ","tree_line_end":18,"tree_line_start":15},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":21,"tree_line_start":19},{"depth":1,"role":"H2","text":"Volume 10 ","tree_line_end":25,"tree_line_start":22},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"Amendment 47 – February 2018 ","tree_line_end":29,"tree_line_start":26},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":33,"tree_line_start":30},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":37,"tree_line_start":34},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"1. This letter provides details on Amendment 47; the changes have already been incorporated in to the Intranet and Internet versions of the DMG.  ","tree_line_end":43,"tree_line_start":38},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":48,"tree_line_start":44},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"2. PDF amendment packages are also available. These can be printed with the amended pages being reproduced in full. Each page will contain the amendment number in the footer.  ","tree_line_end":54,"tree_line_start":49},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":59,"tree_line_start":55},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"PDF amendment packages can be found on the Intranet at: ","tree_line_end":64,"tree_line_start":60},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":69,"tree_line_start":65},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"http://intralink/1/lg/acileeds/guidance/decision%20makers%20guide/index.asp\n ","tree_line_end":81,"tree_line_start":70},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":86,"tree_line_start":82},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" or on the Internet at the ‘Amdt Packages’ tab on the following link: ","tree_line_end":90,"tree_line_start":87},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":94,"tree_line_start":91},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"http://www.dwp.gov.uk/publications/specialist-guides/decision-makers-guide/\n ","tree_line_end":106,"tree_line_start":95},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":111,"tree_line_start":107},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"Note: When printing PDF packages set the print properties to Duplex/Long Edge in order to produce double sided prints. ","tree_line_end":116,"tree_line_start":112},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":121,"tree_line_start":117},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"3. Amendment 47 affects the abbreviations and chapter 59.  The changes:  ","tree_line_end":127,"tree_line_start":122},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":133,"tree_line_start":128},{"depth":1,"role":"L","text":"• Chapter 59 – clarify an example at DMG 59051 and add a further example to that paragraph. ","tree_line_end":140,"tree_line_start":134},{"depth":2,"role":"LI","text":"• Chapter 59 – clarify an example at DMG 59051 and add a further example to that paragraph. ","tree_line_end":140,"tree_line_start":135},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":144,"tree_line_start":141},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"4. If using a PDF amendment package remove the sheets as stated in the left hand column of the Remove and Insert table below and insert the new sheets as stated in the right hand column (note the record of amendments at the back of the Volume). ","tree_line_end":150,"tree_line_start":145},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":155,"tree_line_start":151},{"depth":1,"role":"Table","text":"Remove \nInsert \n \n \nAbbreviations \nAbbreviations \nAbbreviations (5 pages) \nAbbreviations (5 pages) ","tree_line_end":198,"tree_line_start":156},{"depth":2,"role":"TR","text":"Remove \nInsert ","tree_line_end":167,"tree_line_start":159},{"depth":3,"role":"TD","text":"Remove ","tree_line_end":163,"tree_line_start":160},{"depth":4,"role":"P","text":"Remove ","tree_line_end":163,"tree_line_start":161},{"depth":3,"role":"TD","text":"Insert ","tree_line_end":167,"tree_line_start":164},{"depth":4,"role":"P","text":"Insert ","tree_line_end":167,"tree_line_start":165},{"depth":2,"role":"TR","text":" \n ","tree_line_end":176,"tree_line_start":168},{"depth":3,"role":"TD","text":" ","tree_line_end":172,"tree_line_start":169},{"depth":4,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":172,"tree_line_start":170},{"depth":3,"role":"TD","text":" ","tree_line_end":176,"tree_line_start":173},{"depth":4,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":176,"tree_line_start":174},{"depth":2,"role":"TR","text":"Abbreviations \nAbbreviations ","tree_line_end":187,"tree_line_start":177},{"depth":3,"role":"TD","text":"Abbreviations ","tree_line_end":182,"tree_line_start":178},{"depth":4,"role":"P","text":"Abbreviations ","tree_line_end":182,"tree_line_start":179},{"depth":3,"role":"TD","text":"Abbreviations ","tree_line_end":187,"tree_line_start":183},{"depth":4,"role":"P","text":"Abbreviations ","tree_line_end":187,"tree_line_start":184},{"depth":2,"role":"TR","text":"Abbreviations (5 pages) \nAbbreviations (5 pages) ","tree_line_end":198,"tree_line_start":188},{"depth":3,"role":"TD","text":"Abbreviations (5 pages) ","tree_line_end":193,"tree_line_start":189},{"depth":4,"role":"P","text":"Abbreviations (5 pages) ","tree_line_end":193,"tree_line_start":190},{"depth":3,"role":"TD","text":"Abbreviations (5 pages) ","tree_line_end":198,"tree_line_start":194},{"depth":4,"role":"P","text":"Abbreviations (5 pages) ","tree_line_end":198,"tree_line_start":195},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":201,"tree_line_start":199},{"depth":1,"role":"Table","text":"Chapter 59 \nChapter 59 \n59052 – 59080 (2 pages) \n59052 – 59080 (2 pages) ","tree_line_end":222,"tree_line_start":202},{"depth":2,"role":"TR","text":"Chapter 59 \nChapter 59 ","tree_line_end":213,"tree_line_start":205},{"depth":3,"role":"TD","text":"Chapter 59 ","tree_line_end":209,"tree_line_start":